100
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,519
What's wrong?

101
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:41,800
Are you okay?

102
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:57,079
How much are you making

103
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,360
