121
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,839
Earn whatever extra you can.

122
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,560
What's wrong with going back?

123
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,680
Has she always been like this?

124
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:34,600
Mom is the dearest in the world...

125
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:43,000
A child with a mom is like a treasure...

126
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,319
Mom!

127
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:46,680
Mom!

128
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,000
Stop screaming! What do you want?

129
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,759
