133
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,040
and they called me looking for it!

134
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:56,360
So what?

135
00:07:57,079 --> 00:07:58,480
Your brother is still young.

136
00:07:59,079 --> 00:08:00,959
What's wrong with a boy being a little rowdy?

137
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,839
As if you never slacked off.

138
00:08:03,439 --> 00:08:04,680
Me? When did I ever slack off?

139
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,959
