148
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:20,160
I'll figure out the money.

149
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,959
You can solve it?

150
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,120
By selling a kidney?

151
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,920
Why do you have to talk so nasty?

152
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:25,800
Can't you just...

153
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,399
not pick fights the second you get home?

154
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:29,560
He's your brother!

155
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:31,720
As his older sister,

156
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:34,519
can't you help him out a little?

157
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,039
Can't you just treat your brother better?

158
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,679
Either you find someone with a dick

159
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,879
to carry on the family line for me!

160
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:42,399
You always start drama the minute you're back.

161
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,679
You'll have to get married eventually.

162
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,960
You'll marry into another family

163
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,480
and carry on the family line for them.

164
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:49,200
What can I ever count on you for?

165
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,919
You're just...

166
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,879
A married daughter is like spilled water.

167
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,039
I can't count on you.

168
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:54,519
I have to count on my son!

169
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,200
You really just come home looking for trouble.

170
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:10,320
Fu Ting,

171
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,240
don't worry.

172
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,720
I'm a prospective legal professional now.

173
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,039
That tragedy you mentioned...

174
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,120
I've always remembered it.

175
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,519
Once she recovers,

176
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,919
everything will be all right.

177
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,600
Xiaomin.

178
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,120
Director Zhou.

179
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:50,000
What's been going on with you lately?

180
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,240
How could you even get the client's name wrong?

181
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,559
I'm so sorry, Director Zhou.

182
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,360
I'll fix it right away.

183
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,200
Send it over to me.

184
00:09:59,879 --> 00:10:01,440
You haven't been looking well lately.

185
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,399
Is your mother's treatment not going well?

186
