It's okay.

187
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,240
It's just that...

188
00:10:08,519 --> 00:10:10,200
we've been staying together recently,

189
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,440
and the apartment is a bit small.

190
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,759
I just haven't been sleeping well.

191
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,519
I'm sorry, Director Zhou.

192
00:10:15,639 --> 00:10:16,799
I understand. Tell you what.

193
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:18,879
The firm will book a hotel room for you.

194
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,480
Go get some proper rest.

195
00:10:20,559 --> 00:10:21,480
