214
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,600
Let him clear his head,

215
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:11,279
take a hot bath,

216
00:11:11,519 --> 00:11:12,440
and enjoy himself.

217
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,399
Mom.

218
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,440
The firm booked that room for me.

219
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:18,399
They want me to get proper rest

220
00:11:18,399 --> 00:11:19,240
and recharge.

221
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,879
I have a big case coming up,

222
00:11:20,879 --> 00:11:22,120
and I'll be working around the clock.

223
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,759
I knew something was going on.

224
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:29,279
Mom, eat while it's hot.

225
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:30,919
You think I don't know

226
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:32,399
