227
00:11:37,159 --> 00:11:37,840
Why?

228
00:11:38,639 --> 00:11:40,240
Isn't it just sleeping with someone?

229
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,000
What's the big deal?

230
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:43,879
The whole family is counting on you.

231
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:44,879
Couldn't you just put up with it?

232
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,240
How did you know?

233
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,840
I called your company!

234
00:11:53,679 --> 00:11:54,799
The Zhao family's younger daughter,

235
00:11:54,799 --> 00:11:56,039
