237
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,960
So you don't care about me at all, do you?

238
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:00,399
He raped me!

239
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:01,679
And you don't give a damn, do you?

240
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:03,519
All you care about is how much money I give you!

241
00:12:03,519 --> 00:12:04,440
You don't care at all

242
