about what happens to me out there!

243
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,799
What are you getting so worked up about?

244
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,440
Does that even count as rape?

245
00:12:09,799 --> 00:12:12,039
President Xu told me himself,

246
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:14,960
