249
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,879
Am I your daughter?

250
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,840
Am I your own flesh and blood?

251
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,600
Why are you pushing me into a living hell?

252
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,000
What are you acting so innocent for?

253
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,840
Who are you putting on an act for?

254
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,600
Are you some pure virgin?

255
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:31,799
You've had boyfriends before!

256
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,120
What did he say?

257
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,600
President Xu has already relented.

258
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:39,759
As long as you agree,

259
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,919
not only can you get reinstated,

260
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,799
but you can bring some money home too.

261
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:45,840
He's divorcing his wife right now.

262
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:47,919
