263
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,399
This is a great chance!

264
00:12:49,879 --> 00:12:51,720
Grab onto this lifeline,

265
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,559
and not only will you get money...

266
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:54,639
Look at you.

267
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:56,000
What good is your pride?

268
00:12:56,039 --> 00:12:57,159
He got me drunk first!

269
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:58,679
He's the one who got me drunk!

270
00:12:58,799 --> 00:12:59,759
So what if he got you drunk?

271
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
So what if he got you drunk?!

272
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,440
Even if he got you drunk,

273
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,480
