280
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,440
Mom, I'm here!

281
00:13:31,919 --> 00:13:33,120
Sis, open the door!

282
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:37,440
Open up, it's Xiaoqiang!

283
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,799
I'm taking a shower, Xiaoqiang.

284
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,519
Wait a minute.

285
00:13:43,679 --> 00:13:44,639
Hurry up!

286
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:03,480
Xiaomin.

287
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:04,799
Turn yourself in.

288
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,840
What you did is a crime of passion.

289
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,559
By law, you can get a lighter sentence.

290
00:14:18,559 --> 00:14:20,200
Sis, what's taking you so long?

291
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,240
Mom, what are you doing?

292
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,279
Open the door for me.

293
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,639
Mom!

294
00:14:32,639 --> 00:14:33,440
Sis!

295
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,159
My life has already been ruined by her.

296
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,759
What took you so long?

297
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:46,919
Why are you here?

298
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:48,799
Mom told me to come.

299
00:14:48,799 --> 00:14:49,039
Mom?

300
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:50,159
She left.

301
00:14:50,399 --> 00:14:51,200
She left?

302
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:54,279
She said chemo was too painful.

303
00:14:54,279 --> 00:14:55,919
She didn't want treatment and just left.

304
00:14:56,039 --> 00:14:56,960
No more treatment?

305
00:14:57,759 --> 00:14:59,159
Wait, that doesn't make sense.

306
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,559
Mom asked me to come.

307
00:15:00,559 --> 00:15:01,440
I'll ask her.

308
00:15:12,519 --> 00:15:14,120
Why isn't she answering?

309
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,600
You just let her leave like that?

310
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,440
You didn't stop her?

311
00:15:17,799 --> 00:15:19,759
I tried. I told her to hang in there.

312
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:20,759
She didn't want treatment.

313
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,480
We even had a fight.

314
00:15:22,919 --> 00:15:24,759
If you want Mom, go home and look for her!

315
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:25,600
She just left.

316
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:29,879
Sis.

317
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,159
That doesn't sound right.

318
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,320
You just hate Mom.

319
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:44,000
You picked a fight on purpose to drive her away, didn't you?

320
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:46,960
Let me use the bathroom.

321
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:47,799
I really can't hold it anymore.

322
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:48,679
Get out!

323
00:15:50,159 --> 00:15:51,759
I do hate you, and I hate Mom!

324
00:15:51,759 --> 00:15:53,519
Can you two stop bothering me?!

325
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,679
Wait, what are you doing?

326
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,240
Give me some money.

327
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,200
I'm out of cash.

328
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:01,120
Here!

329
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,159
Take it all! Get the hell out!

330
00:16:04,519 --> 00:16:05,960
Don't ever bother me again!

331
00:16:33,799 --> 00:16:34,679
What should I do?
